# Sandscape CLI scaffolding, both regenerable and neither part of the game.
# .sandscape/ is local sync state — a sha256 and version per file, rewritten
# on every push. .agents/ is skill documentation the CLI installs; restore it
# with `sandscape skill install --here`.
.sandscape/
.agents/
# Also CLI-generated, and both say so in their own front matter: they are
# regenerated on every pull, and their advice ("run sandscape pull before
# doing anything", "any structure works") contradicts docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
# A real CLAUDE.md for this project should be hand-written.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
